{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-architecture-mobile","title":"Clean Architecture 移动端实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/clean-architecture-mobile","wordCount":1197,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"clean-architecture-移动端实践\">Clean Architecture 移动端实践</h1><p>Robert C. Martin 在 2012 年提出的 Clean Architecture 并非移动端专属，但它在 iOS 和 Android 社区的落地深度远超 Web 后端——原因在于移动应用天然面临 UI 框架强耦合、平台 SDK 生命周期侵入、离线/在线状态切换等痛点，而 Clean Architecture 的依赖规则恰好为这些问题划出了清晰的隔离边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>依赖规则</strong>：源码依赖只能从外层指向内层，内层不知道外层存在——这是 Clean Architecture 的唯一不可违反的约束</li>\n<li><strong>Use Case 编排</strong>：Application 层的 Use Case 负责编排多个 Repository/Service 的协作并封装业务规则，而非简单代理</li>\n<li><strong>按需分层</strong>：四层模型是最大化方案，简单功能可跳过 Use Case 层让 ViewModel 直接调用 Repository</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心原则-依赖规则\">核心原则：依赖规则</h2><p>Clean Architecture 的全部思想可以压缩为一条规则：<strong>源码依赖只能从外层指向内层，内层不得知道外层的存在。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 外层&#10;        UI[UI / Framework]&#10;        DB[Database / Network]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 中层&#10;        Adapter[Interface Adapters&lt;br/&gt;ViewModel / Presenter / Gateway]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 内层&#10;        UseCase[Use Cases&lt;br/&gt;Application Business Rules]&#10;        Entity[Entities&lt;br/&gt;Enterprise Business Rules]&#10;    end&#10;    UI --&gt; Adapter&#10;    DB --&gt; Adapter&#10;    Adapter --&gt; UseCase&#10;    UseCase --&gt; Entity\">graph TB\n    subgraph 外层\n        UI[UI / Framework]\n        DB[Database / Network]\n    end\n    subgraph 中层\n        Adapter[Interface Adapters&lt;br/&gt;ViewModel / Presenter / Gateway]\n    end\n    subgraph 内层\n        UseCase[Use Cases&lt;br/&gt;Application Business Rules]\n        Entity[Entities&lt;br/&gt;Enterprise Business Rules]\n    end\n    UI --&gt; Adapter\n    DB --&gt; Adapter\n    Adapter --&gt; UseCase\n    UseCase --&gt; Entity</pre><p>内层（Entity + Use Case）是纯业务逻辑，不导入任何平台 SDK。中层（Interface Adapter）做格式转换——将 Use Case 的输出映射为 UI 可渲染的 ViewModel 数据。外层是具体实现——UIKit/SwiftUI、Room/CoreData、Retrofit/URLSession。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>允许的依赖</th>\n<th>典型产物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Entity</td>\n<td>核心业务规则，与应用无关</td>\n<td>无外部依赖</td>\n<td>纯数据类 + 业务验证方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Use Case</td>\n<td>应用级业务编排</td>\n<td>Entity</td>\n<td>Interactor / Service 类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interface Adapter</td>\n<td>格式转换、协议适配</td>\n<td>Use Case 接口</td>\n<td>ViewModel、Repository 接口、Mapper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Framework</td>\n<td>具体技术实现</td>\n<td>Adapter 接口</td>\n<td>Activity/VC、Retrofit/Ktor 实现、Room DAO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"移动端四层落地模型\">移动端四层落地模型</h2><p>在工程实践中，移动社区将 Clean Architecture 简化为四个 Gradle module / SPM target：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>app</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>presentation</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>domain</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>data</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{app} \\rightarrow \\text{presentation} \\rightarrow \\text{domain} \\rightarrow \\text{data}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">app</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">presentation</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">domain</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>domain</code> 模块是整个系统的&quot;心脏&quot;——它定义 Use Case 接口和 Repository 接口，但<strong>不实现</strong>网络/数据库。<code>data</code> 模块实现 Repository 接口，依赖网络库和 ORM。<code>presentation</code> 依赖 <code>domain</code> 但不依赖 <code>data</code>——它通过依赖注入拿到 Repository 的实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// domain 模块 —— 纯 Kotlin，无 Android 依赖&#10;interface OrderRepository {&#10;    suspend fun getOrders(): Result&lt;List&lt;Order&gt;&gt;&#10;    suspend fun placeOrder(order: Order): Result&lt;OrderConfirmation&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class GetOrdersUseCase(private val repository: OrderRepository) {&#10;    suspend operator fun invoke(): Result&lt;List&lt;Order&gt;&gt; {&#10;        return repository.getOrders()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// domain 模块 —— 纯 Kotlin，无 Android 依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface OrderRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getOrders(): Result&#x3C;List&#x3C;Order>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun placeOrder(order: Order): Result&#x3C;OrderConfirmation></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class GetOrdersUseCase(private val repository: OrderRepository) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend operator fun invoke(): Result&#x3C;List&#x3C;Order>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return repository.getOrders()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// domain 模块 —— 纯 Swift，无 UIKit/SwiftUI import&#10;protocol OrderRepository {&#10;    func getOrders() async throws -&gt; [Order]&#10;    func placeOrder(_ order: Order) async throws -&gt; OrderConfirmation&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct GetOrdersUseCase {&#10;    private let repository: OrderRepository&#10;&#10;    func execute() async throws -&gt; [Order] {&#10;        try await repository.getOrders()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// domain 模块 —— 纯 Swift，无 UIKit/SwiftUI import</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [Order]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> placeOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order: Order) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrderConfirmation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GetOrdersUseCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repository: OrderRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [Order] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repository.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">getOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"use-case-的粒度判断\">Use Case 的粒度判断</h2><p>一个常见错误是 Use Case 退化为 Repository 的透传代理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 反模式：Use Case 只是 Repository 的一层包装&#10;class GetOrdersUseCase(private val repo: OrderRepository) {&#10;    suspend operator fun invoke() = repo.getOrders()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 反模式：Use Case 只是 Repository 的一层包装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class GetOrdersUseCase(private val repo: OrderRepository) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend operator fun invoke() = repo.getOrders()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 Use Case 只有单行代码时，需要反思它是否值得存在。Use Case 的价值在于<strong>编排多个 Repository/Service 的协作</strong>并封装业务规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 有价值的 Use Case：跨数据源编排 + 业务规则&#10;class PlaceOrderUseCase(&#10;    private val orderRepo: OrderRepository,&#10;    private val inventoryRepo: InventoryRepository,&#10;    private val paymentService: PaymentService&#10;) {&#10;    suspend operator fun invoke(cart: Cart): Result&lt;OrderConfirmation&gt; {&#10;        // 业务规则：验证库存&#10;        val available = inventoryRepo.checkAvailability(cart.items)&#10;        if (!available) return Result.failure(OutOfStockException())&#10;&#10;        // 业务规则：计算折扣&#10;        val finalPrice = cart.totalPrice * discountFactor(cart.items.size)&#10;&#10;        // 编排：先扣款再下单&#10;        paymentService.charge(finalPrice).getOrElse { return Result.failure(it) }&#10;        return orderRepo.placeOrder(cart.toOrder(finalPrice))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun discountFactor(itemCount: Int): Double = when {&#10;        itemCount &gt;= 10 -&gt; 0.85&#10;        itemCount &gt;= 5 -&gt; 0.92&#10;        else -&gt; 1.0&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 有价值的 Use Case：跨数据源编排 + 业务规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class PlaceOrderUseCase(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val orderRepo: OrderRepository,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val inventoryRepo: InventoryRepository,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val paymentService: PaymentService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend operator fun invoke(cart: Cart): Result&#x3C;OrderConfirmation> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 业务规则：验证库存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val available = inventoryRepo.checkAvailability(cart.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!available) return Result.failure(OutOfStockException())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 业务规则：计算折扣</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val finalPrice = cart.totalPrice * discountFactor(cart.items.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 编排：先扣款再下单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        paymentService.charge(finalPrice).getOrElse { return Result.failure(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return orderRepo.placeOrder(cart.toOrder(finalPrice))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun discountFactor(itemCount: Int): Double = when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        itemCount >= 10 -> 0.85</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        itemCount >= 5 -> 0.92</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>经验法则：如果一个 Use Case 涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个数据源，或包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 条业务规则，它就有存在的理由。否则让 ViewModel 直接调用 Repository。</p>\n<h2 id=\"data-层的-repository-模式\">Data 层的 Repository 模式</h2><p>Repository 模式在移动端的核心价值是<strong>封装数据来源的切换逻辑</strong>——调用方不知道数据来自网络、本地缓存还是内存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class OrderRepositoryImpl(&#10;    private val remoteDataSource: OrderRemoteDataSource,&#10;    private val localDataSource: OrderLocalDataSource&#10;) : OrderRepository {&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun getOrders(): Result&lt;List&lt;Order&gt;&gt; {&#10;        // 策略：先读缓存，后台刷新&#10;        val cached = localDataSource.getOrders()&#10;        if (cached.isNotEmpty()) {&#10;            refreshInBackground()&#10;            return Result.success(cached)&#10;        }&#10;        return remoteDataSource.getOrders().also { result -&gt;&#10;            result.onSuccess { localDataSource.saveOrders(it) }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun refreshInBackground() {&#10;        coroutineScope.launch {&#10;            remoteDataSource.getOrders().onSuccess {&#10;                localDataSource.saveOrders(it)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class OrderRepositoryImpl(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val remoteDataSource: OrderRemoteDataSource,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val localDataSource: OrderLocalDataSource</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : OrderRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun getOrders(): Result&#x3C;List&#x3C;Order>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 策略：先读缓存，后台刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val cached = localDataSource.getOrders()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (cached.isNotEmpty()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            refreshInBackground()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return Result.success(cached)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return remoteDataSource.getOrders().also { result -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            result.onSuccess { localDataSource.saveOrders(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun refreshInBackground() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coroutineScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            remoteDataSource.getOrders().onSuccess {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                localDataSource.saveOrders(it)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"层间数据传递与-mapper\">层间数据传递与 Mapper</h2><p>每层使用自己的数据模型，通过 Mapper 做转换。这避免了网络层 JSON 字段变更直接穿透到 UI：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>数据模型</th>\n<th>命名惯例</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Data (Remote)</td>\n<td><code>OrderDto</code> / <code>OrderResponse</code></td>\n<td>后缀 Dto/Response</td>\n<td>匹配 API JSON 结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data (Local)</td>\n<td><code>OrderEntity</code></td>\n<td>后缀 Entity</td>\n<td>匹配数据库表结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Domain</td>\n<td><code>Order</code></td>\n<td>无后缀</td>\n<td>纯业务模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Presentation</td>\n<td><code>OrderUiModel</code> / <code>OrderListState</code></td>\n<td>后缀 UiModel/State</td>\n<td>匹配 UI 渲染需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Mapper 实现为 extension function（Kotlin）或 computed property（Swift），保持无状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun OrderDto.toDomain(): Order = Order(&#10;    id = this.orderId,&#10;    items = this.lineItems.map { it.toDomain() },&#10;    status = OrderStatus.fromApiCode(this.statusCode),&#10;    createdAt = Instant.parse(this.createdAtIso)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun OrderDto.toDomain(): Order = Order(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id = this.orderId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    items = this.lineItems.map { it.toDomain() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    status = OrderStatus.fromApiCode(this.statusCode),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    createdAt = Instant.parse(this.createdAtIso)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"过度分层的识别与治疗\">过度分层的识别与治疗</h2><p>Clean Architecture 最常见的反模式是<strong>机械套用四层导致简单功能需要修改 8 个文件</strong>。识别信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个 CRUD 操作需要 Entity + DTO + UiModel + Mapper × 2 + UseCase + Repository Interface + Repository Impl + ViewModel = 9 个类</li>\n<li>团队新人读一个功能需要跳转 &gt; 5 个文件才能理解数据流</li>\n<li>Use Case 层 80% 的类只有一行代码</li>\n</ul>\n<p>治疗方案不是放弃分层，而是<strong>按功能复杂度调整层的厚度</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>层数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>业务规则复杂度</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>数据源数量</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>团队规模</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{层数} = f(\\text{业务规则复杂度}, \\text{数据源数量}, \\text{团队规模})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">层数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">业务规则复杂度</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据源数量</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">团队规模</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>简单的列表展示页面可以让 ViewModel 直接调用 Repository（跳过 Use Case）；只有当业务编排逻辑出现时才引入 Use Case。这种&quot;按需分层&quot;策略在 Google 官方 Android Architecture Guide（2024 更新版）中被明确推荐。</p>\n<p>与 <a href=\"mvc-mvp-mvvm\">MVC/MVP/MVVM</a> 的关系：Clean Architecture 不替代 MVVM，而是为 MVVM 的 ViewModel 提供了&quot;背后的层&quot;——它回答的是&quot;ViewModel 调用谁来获取数据&quot;，而 MVVM 回答的是&quot;View 如何感知 ViewModel 的状态变化&quot;。两者正交组合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Clean Architecture 在移动端的价值不在于&quot;有四层&quot;，而在于一条依赖规则带来的隔离保证——Domain 层可以在不启动任何 Android/iOS 框架的情况下运行完整单元测试。过度分层的解药不是放弃分层，而是按功能复杂度动态调整层的厚度。当你发现 80% 的 Use Case 只有一行代码时，那说明你的业务确实简单——直接让 ViewModel 调用 Repository 是正确的简化。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Clean Architecture 移动端实践","id":"clean-architecture-移动端实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心原则：依赖规则","id":"核心原则-依赖规则"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端四层落地模型","id":"移动端四层落地模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Use Case 的粒度判断","id":"use-case-的粒度判断"},{"level":2,"text":"Data 层的 Repository 模式","id":"data-层的-repository-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"层间数据传递与 Mapper","id":"层间数据传递与-mapper"},{"level":2,"text":"过度分层的识别与治疗","id":"过度分层的识别与治疗"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MVC、MVP 与 MVVM 的演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/mvc-mvp-mvvm"},"next":{"title":"单向数据流架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/unidirectional-data-flow"}}